  "title": "Egg Muffins",
  "description": "Egg muffins, with spinach, bacon, mushrooms, and onion, are an excellent and paleo-friendly way to start your day.",
  "authors": [
    "Chris Denzer"
  ],
  "date_published": "2016-01-27T02:01:42-05:00",
